{"id": "reczz28LeeYH59r1", "order": 3, "images": ["/media/e8f116d67a5aaddfc1491cce.jpg", "/media/39507e5c534be3bfa456828a.jpg", "/media/9040f72d70319b957691defa.jpg", "/media/4a134bc8dc0615f60209930d.jpg", "/media/29b6777066ba4c9d0d26efd1.jpg", "/media/dc71f7b48d27ff067fc7680c.jpg", "/media/17e4a5689a3d71e17bc24bdc.jpg", "/media/3a1595750094a6bf9a1d99f1.jpg"], "name": "Liquid Glacial（液态冰川）", "originalName": "Liquid Glacial", "termName": "清透", "author": "Zaha Hadid", "year": "2012–2017", "medium": "家具", "collection": "", "caption": "", "why": "仿佛有人把流动的水，直接凝固成了一张桌子。", "whyLong": "透明亚克力桌子的表面保持平整，下面却有层层水纹，纹路向下汇聚成漩涡般的桌腿。原本坚硬的家具，看起来像一股正在流动的清水。\n\n清透不等于透明。透明是材料的性质，清透是一种视觉感受——这张桌子证明：坚硬的东西也可以存在得很轻。", "scene": "", "detail": "", "method": "", "twist": "", "absence": "", "extra": "", "official": "https://www.zaha-hadid-design.com/pages/liquid"}